    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18311" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφθογγος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>voiceless, speechless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Cer.
				198
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.116
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόβῳ ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					206
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. εἶναι</span> remain
				<i>silent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				448
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἄγγελος</span> a
			beacon-fire, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				549
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφθόγγῳ φθεγγομένα
			στόματι,</span> of an epitaph, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				234.4
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Smyrna</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφθογγα</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γράμματα</span>) <i>mutes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				18c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cra.</u>
				424c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφατος</span>
			, <i>not to be spoken of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					618
				</span></i>
			 (dub.).</div>
